 "about": "Kingdom v5, the full game: days of 60 seconds, nights of 45, five nights (about nine minutes). This is the save to hand to a person. The script plays one sensible line so that every part runs once: day 1 two citizens, the builder, an archer, the wooden wall; day 2 a farmer; day 3 a second archer and a second farmer; day 4 the keep and a third archer; day 5 the wall again if it fell, and stone. It stands by the wall at night, where the arrows and the Greed can be seen. A person plays differently and may well lose: whether the numbers are right is for a person to say (balance.py tries the rules without the game).",
